# tab-series-stacked (M8; the M5b review's carry-over): the stacked page (800 x 900), the plane under
# the panel (824.5..1304.5), in Chromium's Tab order (call 3 f). Tab to the plane shows the plane's
# keys at the panel's foot, pushing the plane down 49 px, and the page scrolls until the plane's
# foot is the window's, measured after that as WebKit measures it (plan call 3 o): 454, where
# Chromium measures before the tip and stops at 405, the plane's foot 48.5 px below the window
# (tab-plane-stacked judges the scroll against WebKit). Return to origin and the zoom capsule show
# as they are, the page back at 421 as the tip goes; past the last stop the focus leaves; Shift+Tab
# back to the plane rises to 454 again. The rings are judged against Chromium.
size 800 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
wait 16
tab
wait 16
tab
wait 16
